:"Rohit Hasnani",designation:"Associate Product Manager, Droom",image:"/images/logos/droom.png",content:"Ola Maps has been instrumental in helping us solve our location-based challenges while developing the Droom Super App. Their robust tech and collaborative support greatly improved our execution speed."},{id:4,name:"Srinivas",designation:"Co Founder - Head of Product & Data Analytics, Tipplr",image:"/images/logos/tipplr.png",content:"At Tipplr, we needed a reliable way to show customers the real-time distance between them and nearby restaurants to improve transparency and ordering decisions. Ola Maps' Distance Matrix API enabled us to deliver accurate, low-latency distance estimates within our food delivery app. Combined with their geolocation services, this helped us streamline delivery routing and reduce customer complaints related to ETA mismatches. We've seen a 22% drop in delivery delays and improved user trust in our platform."}];e.s(["default",0,()=>{let[e,l]=(0,r.useState)(0);return(0,r.useEffect)(()=>{let e=setInterval(()=>{l(e=>(e+1)%s.length)},5e3);return()=>clearInterval(e)},[]),(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:(0,t.jsx)("section",{className:"overflow-hidden lg:px-[120px] 2xl:px-[310px] xl:px-[280px] md:py-[50px] bg-white xl:py-[100px] lg:py-[80px] md:px-[40px] px-[20px] py-[40px]",children:(0,t.jsx)("div",{className:"mx-auto min-h-[600px] w-full pt-12 lg:pt-16 pb-12 lg:pb-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-white via-transparent to-white backdrop-blur-xs",children:(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8",children:[(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-8 lg:mb-12",children:[(0,t.jsx)("div",{className:"w-full lg:w-1/3 flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start",children:(0,t.jsx)("h2",{className:"text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-gentona font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] text-gray-800 text-center lg:text-left",children:"Hear from our Customers"})}),(0,t.jsx)("div",{clas